description: >-
  The AI creative-engineering MCP server for Roblox. Generates production-grade
  GUIs, Luau script systems, design tokens, thumbnails and project scaffolds —
  every artifact audited (WCAG contrast, touch targets, text sizes) before it
  is returned. Build beyond imagination.
abstract: >-
  GEORGE GUI @Search is a Model Context Protocol server that turns natural
  language into complete Roblox interfaces: self-contained Luau ModuleScripts
  with theme tokens, animations, responsive layout and controller APIs, each
  passing an automated quality audit (contrast math, touch-target sizes, text
  sizes) before delivery. It also provides Roblox-specialised Luau static
  analysis, secure-by-default script templates, Rojo/Rokit/Wally project
  scaffolds, an offline deterministic thumbnail renderer, and a source-linked
  research knowledge base.
